{"id":"n64528-1-8","stage":3,"title":"다녀가다 · 来过","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64528-1-8-1","ko":"벽에 붙어 있는 이 사진들은 뭐예요?","zh":"贴在墙上的这些照片是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벽에","meaning":"墙壁，墙壁","explanation":"벽：墙壁，墙壁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"벽","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28231","senseId":"1","lemma":"벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붙어","meaning":"粘上，吸附","explanation":"붙다：粘上，吸附；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"붙다","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74181","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진들은","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a30f11b63eeef594","term":"벽","zh":"墙壁，墙壁","audio":"/audio/a30f11b63eeef594e419.mp3","entryId":"28231","definition":"围绕房子或房间周围的部分。","pronunciation":["벽"]},{"id":"25c69080a9810c70","term":"붙다","zh":"粘上，吸附","audio":"/audio/25c69080a9810c70a4d0.mp3","entryId":"74181","definition":"某物附在某处而不脱落。","pronunciation":["붇따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/96be5dc178841060ca8f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64528-1-8-2","ko":"그동안 이 카페를 다녀간 손님들이 남긴 거예요.","zh":"是这些日子来这家咖啡馆的顾客们留下的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"카페를","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀간","meaning":"来过，到过","explanation":"다녀가다：来过，到过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다녀가다","audio":"/audio/b752b475a0c6e66fea4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64528","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님들이","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남긴","meaning":"留下","explanation":"남기다：留下；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"6","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"53cc9fb21b3694bf","term":"카페","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3","entryId":"72162","definition":"主要销售咖啡、茶、点心等的店铺。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b752b475a0c6e66f","term":"다녀가다","zh":"来过，到过","audio":"/audio/b752b475a0c6e66fea4a.mp3","entryId":"64528","definition":"来到某地后又离开。","pronunciation":["다녀가다"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"a129ccc910d85b76","term":"남기다","zh":"留下","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3","entryId":"64371","definition":"使感情或记忆等不消逝，继续存在下去。","pronunciation":["남기다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd3305de2d72db9393ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.748,"source":{"ur